    "authority":"project-scope-v1-direct-relations",
    "bootstrap":"Only true new org-owned ownership-origin, verified creator, no ever-personal owner, unconsumed, active memberships and project-write plus CAS. First personal assignment permanently consumes; returning to org does not reactivate creator privileges. No origin or historical unknown fails closed.",
    "initialProducer":"Direct CreateProject starts with real actor as personal owner and consumed origin; Lead.convertToProject uses actual conversion operator as project creator and actual inherited owner, creates origin in the same transaction. No historical synthetic backfill.",
    "supportingCorrections":["Existing owner reassignment verifies prior owner or exact first-assignment bootstrap before writing new owner","Existing D prepare verifies real current owner before producing any participant delegation"],
    "GHWrite":"Finance-manage permission AND (OwnerWrite OR delegated confirmed finance duty OR delegated confirmed business-admin duty). Duties must be real current handover facts.",
    "GHRead":"OwnerRead or actual project participant, independently enforce sensitive projections. Own-condition-only and creator-first-assignment-only do not grant operating or commission detail access.",
    "unmodeledManagerExceptions":"Fail closed; same org, ancestor org, roleKey, system-role flag or a bare write permission never manufacture project scope.",
